OBSERVATION: exit 1, tiada output jumpa (grep tiada match)
TOOL_CALL: {"name": "run_bash", "args": {"cmd": "bash -c 'set -e; if grep -q pola tiada.txt 2>/dev/null; then echo jumpa; else echo tiada-match-tapi-ok; fi'"}}
